an><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">==</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">base</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is well-formed and convertible to <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">2)</span> This overload participates in overload resolution only if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">base</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy3\">!</span><span class=\"sy1\">=</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">base</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is well-formed and convertible to <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">3)</span> This overload participates in overload resolution only if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">base</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">base</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is well-formed and convertible to <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">4)</span> This overload participates in overload resolution only if <code class=\"t-c\"><span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\">lhs.<span class=\"me1\">base</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&gt;=</span> rhs.<span class=\"me1\">base</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span></span></code> is well-formed and convertible to <span class=\"mw-geshi cpp source-cpp\"><span class=\"kw4\">bool</span></span>.</div>\n<div class=\"t-li1\"><span class=\"t-li\">5)</span> This overload participates in overload resolution only if <code class=